{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a skilled blacksmith and experience the beginnings of your very own forge in this immersive simulation game. In this limited demo, you\u2019ll get to play through the first <strong>three in-game days</strong>, crafting and selling weapons and armor such as swords, shields, and war hammers to visiting customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hone your craftsmanship as you forge high-quality gear, set your prices, and manage resources to satisfy your clients. While the full game offers shop upgrades and material improvements, the demo provides a glimpse into the core mechanics with a selection of available items to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that <strong>progress will not be saved</strong> in this demo, and not all items will be accessible. Test your skills, build your reputation, and get a taste of what it takes to run a thriving forge!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563770?t=1741534296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563770?t=1741534296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563770/f1b7f97b972c27382b76dae076c0f57bd7c80153/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741534296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563770/f1b7f97b972c27382b76dae076c0f57bd7c80153/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741534296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a skilled blacksmith and experience the beginnings of your very own forge in this immersive simulation game. In this limited demo, you\u2019ll get to play through the first <strong>three in-game days</strong>, crafting and selling weapons and armor such as swords, shields, and war hammers to visiting customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hone your craftsmanship as you forge high-quality gear, set your prices, and manage resources to satisfy your clients. While the full game offers shop upgrades and material improvements, the demo provides a glimpse into the core mechanics with a selection of available items to craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that <strong>progress will not be saved</strong> in this demo, and not all items will be accessible. Test your skills, build your reputation, and get a taste of what it takes to run a thriving forge!</p>","developers":["Dual Cluster Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3563710","name":"Black Smith Shop Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563770/7ec76194ff69acb35db196d934c83e3a0906c08a/header.jpg?t=1741534296","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Black Smith Shop Simulator Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3550<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX960<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><